[[Zaishen Fighter]]s are [[Warrior]] Zaishen Henchmen found in PvP areas involving the [[Zaishen Order|Zaishen]]. They can also be found in the previous PvP outpost [[Tomb of the Primeval Kings]], since it used to be the lobby for the [[Heroes' Ascent]].

==Locations==
*[[Core]]
**[[The Battle Isles]]
***{{NPC location|Heroes' Ascent}} (one of the [[List of Zaishen Challenges henchmen|possible replacements]] if you enter a match with less than eight [[party]] members)
***{{NPC location|Training Arena}} (if you enter with a party that has two or less members) 
***{{NPC location|Zaishen Challenge|outpost}}
***{{NPC location|Zaishen Elite|outpost}}
*[[Guild Wars Prophecies|Prophecies]]
**[[Crystal Desert]]
***{{NPC location|Tomb of the Primeval Kings}}

